{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Deploy the Royal Navy to turn illegal small boats back to France",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We believe no boats containing illegal migrants should be allowed to land on our shores, including illegal migrants rescued at sea. We want the UK Government to deploy Royal Navy vessels to turn back all small boats that are attempting to illegally cross the Channel into the UK back to France.",
